  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJsQqRQcdYwokRCCgCRYsZiHs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aRmJ5MDJjWHBRZDNKdFdrRmZiM05JTVhBMVMwRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Working with Drew and the team has been a genuine asset to our marketing firm and clients. As Fractional CMOs, we bring Drew in on SEO and paid search across multiple client accounts, and he consistently delivers. He digs into the data, brings clear strategic recommendations, and explains the \"why\" behind every move so our team and our clients always know where things stand.\n\nWhat stands out most is that Drew and his team work like true partners, not a vendor. They are responsive, collaborative, and accountable to real results rather than vanity metrics. We have seen ranking and traffic gains for our clients, and the regular reporting and communication makes the progress easy to track and share.\n\nAbsolutely recommend Digital Drew without hesitation.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
