    {
      "name": "places/ChIJsQqRQcdYwokRCCgCRYsZiHs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSMk9VeDVNM2cwWm1KaE9ETkllbk5MZW10blJrRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "We’ve worked with Drew and Georgia for nearly three years, and they’ve been an outstanding SEO partner. They’re knowledgeable, reliable, responsive, and consistently deliver meaningful results, even while working within our relatively modest budget.\n\nWhat I appreciate most is how proactive they are. Every meeting is more than just a status update. They come prepared with thoughtful ideas, brainstorm solutions alongside us, and help us think strategically about content, website improvements, and SEO opportunities. Their depth of knowledge makes it easy to bring any question to the table, and they always provide practical, well-reasoned recommendations.\n\nIf you’re looking for an SEO agency that feels like an extension of your team rather than just another vendor, I highly recommend working with Drew, Georgia, and the rest of the team.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
